\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, I think I've brought everything except the kitchen sink.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Here, I'll grab your camera and purse.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, that will be my exercise for the week!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going to put these things straight into the fridge. They're perishable and the air-conditioning in my car wasn't working.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Check out the pantry. I'm now putting everything into plastic containers.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Impressive. You've cleaned too. The flowers are a nice touch.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well ... You said you were bringing your camera so ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is this the processor from work?  It looks dangerous.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Only if you stick your finger inside it and turn it on ... <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm hoping that you have some mirin left. I forgot to grab some at the supermarket this morning.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I spent half of my morning surfing the Internet. The other half was spent soaking up the sun on my patio.", "time": "26000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Anything interesting on the net?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, just a lot of cat videos. I'm going to turn on some tunes.  I like listening to music when I'm in the kitchen.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Now, I promised Marleene some photos, and possibly a slideshow of our cooking adventures.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Shouldn't you be writing something too? You are a journalist, after all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well ... maybe I'll include a little paragraph to accompany the photos ... if she's lucky.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I love hanging out with you!", "time": "50000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn7le18ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> What could you include in a descriptive paragraph about a meal</span>?", "time": "26000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What should the topic sentence be followed by?</span>", "time": "58500", "id": 2}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}